    "created_at": "2016-03-08T10:29:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-08T10:29:27Z",
    "body": "WebIDL says \"The internal [[Prototype]] property of an interface object for a callback interface must be the Object.prototype object.\"\n\nI think that means that `Object.getPrototypeOf(NodeFilter) === Object.prototype` should hold true, but it doesn't in Edge or Gecko.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
