    "created_at": "2016-03-08T10:32:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-08T10:32:15Z",
    "body": "Aha, it looks like `Object.getPrototypeOf(NodeFilter) === Function.prototype` holds true. I don't think that's what WebIDL is saying, so I'll file an issue...\n",
